Package: artpaint
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: layered raster painting and image-manipulation app for VitruvianOS
 ArtPaint is a painting and image-processing program with layers,
 selections, a brush store, text tools and 27 add-on image filters.
 It imports and exports through the translation kit.
